WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.570
Look at her go.
She really is a gutsy girl!

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.580
Sara...

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.530
This is how fried shrimp should be!

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.400
Yeah!

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.330
Sara Cruz... What a girl.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.940
She's already captured
the hearts of everyone,

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.600
despite having just transferred
to the Spatial Armor Division.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.910
--See you later!
--See ya!

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.940
Well, we'll see you later!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.180
Take care!

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.750
Yeah, take care.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:59.220
But, actually...

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.800
But actually... But actually...

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:13.100
Sara-san! I'm the one who
likes you the most of all!

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:19.210
Lavinia`s Lovely Plot

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.490
Ten seconds to
deceleration completion!

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:30.420
Eight! Seven! Six!

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.360
Five! Four! Three!

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.730
Two! One!

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.970
--We've now left sub-light speed!
--Time synchronization complete!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:45.510
Transmit the message to
the Gall Space Supply Depot.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:47.170
Understood.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.610
Now we can catch our breath...

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:51.110
However, as we don't know
the enemy's objective,

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:55.620
I believe we should act based
on the worst-case scenario.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.450
That they'll follow us, huh?

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.940
Yes, sir.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:09.130
We've now left sub-light speed.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.600
Enemy vessel detected.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.130
Just as predicted...

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.270
Captain Medlock. Shall we pursue?

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.940
Of course we will.

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:20.240
You're absolutely certain?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.240
I'm saying go ahead.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.550
You have your orders, Barrow!

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:29.480
Follow the enemy vessel on present
course at Combat Speed #2!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.810
Understood.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.160
Emily. Go back to the room.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.320
Your ID has not been authenticated.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.480
Admittance into this
section is forbidden.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.360
You understand, don't you, Ralph?

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:21.860
There's a time limit. We'll have to
strike when the ship leaves port...

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.880
Oh, you...

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.210
Ralph...

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.190
Your ID has not been authenticated.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:50.720
Admittance into this
section is forbidden.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:08.800
How boring...

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.900
Alright! That should do it!
Bring the doll!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.070
"Emily"!

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:29.590
Whatever!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.770
Sara! Sorry for the wait!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.510
I tried increasing its
reaction speed by 10%.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.280
It might feel like you're
being thrown around a bit,

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.510
but don't mind that.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:57.430
Alright, let's begin the simulation.
Start 'er up, Carmichael.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.090
Commencing simulation!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.660
Here we go, Emily.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.530
Sorry, Sara...

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.100
C'mon! A few fires aren't
that big of a deal!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.300
Look, you!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.840
Go ahead and waste some
time somewhere, Sara.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:39.410
I think it'll take a little while to fix...

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:43.440
Okay. Then I'll go take a shower.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.280
This could be my chance!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.220
--Sara-san!
--Lavinia?

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:57.260
Oh, my! What happened to you?
And Emily-chan is all dirty, too...

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:01.160
Yes. I'm just about
to take a shower now.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.760
Really?

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.970
Okay! In that case, I'll make
Emily-chan nice and pretty again

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:09.200
while you're in the shower!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.170
Lavinia...

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.330
--Sara...
--Thank you, Lavinia!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:20.780
And then Sara will be all mine!

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:24.380
What happened, Sara? You're a mess!

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.750
Lottie... Jessie...

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:30.220
Even Emily's all filthy...

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.560
Go take a shower, you!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.390
T-that's what I'm supposed to-

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:39.000
While you're in there, Jessie'll
make Emily nice and pretty again!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.900
--I will?
--But...

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:45.810
Don't hold back!
Jessie's great at this sort of thing!

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:48.670
I'm great at that sort of thing?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.380
Don't sweat the details, Jessie!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.740
Why did it turn out that way?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.160
A must-have for any maiden...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.170
...a crystal thumbtack!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:18.130
They can be stuck anywhere with ease,
and they don't stand out!

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:26.370
Okay, all set! With this here...

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.290
Ouch!

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.160
Oh! Whatever's the matter, Sara?!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.820
Oh, my! You're bleeding!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.450
Lavinia...

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.770
There, all better!

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.400
Lavinia...

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:55.340
Thank you, Lavinia...

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.080
And then Sara will be all mine!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.980
There she is!

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:13.690
--Ouch!
--Now!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.130
What's wrong, Sara-san?

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:20.530
Oh, you're bleeding! Let's get you
to the infirmary right away!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:22.030
This isn't that bad of a cut.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:28.640
But I'll be a failure as a medic
if I overlook someone who's hurt!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:30.780
Alright, Becky...

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:34.450
Let's get you to the infirmary.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.280
Yes.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.250
Wait!

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:48.520
Why did it turn out this way?

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.940
There she is!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.040
I guess I'll just have to show her
my charm up close and personal!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.700
Shh! There's nothing to be afraid of!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:28.630
Just leave it to me...

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:39.210
Yes! Now Sara is all mine!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.550
I've been using that shampoo for years.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:43.820
It'll bring out your hair's luster, Sara!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:47.520
--Eh?!
--But I have my own...

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:52.290
It couldn't be...

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.830
J- J- J- Jessie?!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.270
No, just give it a try!
I know you'll like it!

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:01.870
S-stop, Jessie! This isn't what you-

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:05.330
--It's a small misunderstanding!
--Lavinia...

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.440
Lavinia... Jessie... What are you...

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:14.510
N-no! It's not what you think!
It's a misunderstanding! Yeah!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.040
S- Sara!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.890
W-wait! Let's keep going!

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:32.160
W-why did it turn out this way?!

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:38.040
Why?

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.970
L- Lavinia?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:44.110
Eh?!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:48.380
Okay, Lavinia! I fully
understand how you feel!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:51.980
I'll show you all my charm
up close and personal!

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:55.220
What do you think? Come on!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.520
No!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.890
I don't like this!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:12.270
I hear a student is running around,
behaving strangely lately.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.270
Acting strangely? How so?

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.510
--That, huh?
--"That?"

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:21.450
Lavinia's naked lap around
the ship! It's famous!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.550
Huh?! You have to be kidding me!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.950
It's the truth. I saw it myself!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.620
What an appalling young woman!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.020
I believe Lavinia may not
be the only issue here.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:35.360
I feel the cadets' stress
may be nearing its limit.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:37.560
What was to be an exercise
turns into real combat,

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:41.630
and they lose over half of their friends
in a sub-light speed battle.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.600
On top of that, it's conceivable
that we're being pursued.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.810
I can't say I blame them.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:51.410
On the front lines, unforeseeable
situations can occur at any time.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.850
Each person is responsible for
relieving his or her own stress.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.610
That's to be expected of a soldier.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.720
But they're still just cadets, you know.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.150
As a doctor, I can't overlook this.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:04.720
I believe they need
to let off a little steam.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:09.160
Yes. In that case...

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:13.170
This ship will arrive at
the Gall Space Supply Depot shortly.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.070
We originally planned to conduct
training inside the ship

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.670
during re-supply and repairs.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.740
However, all training is hereby
cancelled for the first day

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.610
in lieu of a day of free time.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.840
Shore leave on Gall is also granted.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.670
We made it!

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:51.700
This is Basion Tactical Training School's
training ship, the Libertad.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:57.040
This is Gall Control. We confirm that.
Enter port through Gate #3.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.770
Roger that.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.920
Director Radofrics!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.980
The Construction Bureau
has sent a complaint.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:08.950
They say we can't use Gate #3,
as it'll delay their sensor installation.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:13.360
We can't help it!
That's the only place that was open!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.930
Their main bridge has been blown away!

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.930
It's amazing they stayed afloat like this!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:24.340
They were really lucky!
It must've been beginner's luck!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.420
Don't go out of control
and hurt yourselves, now!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.950
You're lucky to still have your lives!
Don't let it go to waste!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.120
Heya, Queen and company!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.760
Oh! You're about to leave, too?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:49.230
The lovely ladies of Gall
are waiting for me, you see.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:51.430
Don't cry when you
get the cold shoulder!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.830
Where's Sara?

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:56.200
--She says she's going to stay here.
--Eh?

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.500
I've gone out of my way
to invite you along!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.380
Fine, whatever! Let's go!

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:07.250
Sara...

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.680
She says she can better focus on
training when no one's around.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.520
I see.

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:15.520
Okay, let's go!

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.460
That's too bad, Carris-kun.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.190
Stop it, already!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:22.490
My chance!

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:28.970
Okay! You're all granted leave.
Be back on time, though!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.470
Huh? Lavinia's not here...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.970
Now that you mention it...

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.040
She might want to do stuff on her own.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.310
Plus her three naked
laps around the ship

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.980
seem to have been quite hard on her...

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.420
Yeah, that's true, too...

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.920
Was one lap not enough for her libido?

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:50.960
She can get pretty high-strung,
that's for sure!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.060
Her number of laps has gone up?!

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.290
Well, I guess it doesn't
matter either way...

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:03.870
I've set it so all simulation modes
can be controlled from the cockpit.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.000
Continual operation is possible,

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.810
but be sure to take
a 15-minute break every hour.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:12.640
Don't push yourself too hard
just 'cause you're young! Okay?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.350
Let's hurry, Carmichael.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:17.920
The old guy is known for
closing the shop on a whim.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:20.040
See you later, Sara!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.350
Who left just now?!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.690
ID verified. It's Ralph Werec.

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:04.620
Going off on his own again?!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:08.630
Captain Medlock just had
to give him a Level E ID!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.860
What have I done, now?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.470
No, I don't mean you, Captain.
It's Ralph who-

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.270
How are you here?! Then, who's in the-

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.570
I'm coming to see you now!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:35.180
Let's take a short break, Emily...

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:50.970
I know the truth! You're Sara's
best friend, aren't you?!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:54.340
So if you were to suddenly go missing...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.240
My Emily is missing!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.680
My! That's terrible!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.720
Don't cry, Sara!
I'll help you look for her!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.450
Okay?

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:11.160
I found her, Sara! Here you go!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:14.890
Thank you, Lavinia!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.530
Now Sara will be all mine!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.230
So there you go!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:31.340
Wait there for just a little bit, okay?

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:46.860
Emily? Emily?!

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.890
She's troubled! She's troubled!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.900
Now I'll just do it like my plan and-

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.600
Where are you?! Emily! Emily!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:58.070
Oh, Sara-san! Whatever's the matter?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:00.210
Lavinia! Have you seen Emily?!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.870
The girl! The girl that was here!
She's gone!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.980
My! That's terrible!
I- I'll help y-you...

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:10.980
She's... the only thing I have left!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.550
I absolutely can't lose her!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:17.490
Emily... is my last hope!

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:18.990
S- Sara...

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:22.480
I think I know where she might be!

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.930
I'm sorry, Sara! I'll never
do anything like this again!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:34.610
Sara-san! See! She's right up there!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.510
Eep!

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:40.910
What?! I know I put her
there just a minute ago!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.910
Emily was here?

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.710
Why would you bring her here?

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:51.890
S- Sara-san?

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:56.550
--Could she have... Emily!
--Sara-san!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.570
W-where'd the garbage go?!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.400
It's all been picked up.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.610
Sara-san!

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.470
It was just a sudden impulse!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.640
I thought you'd be bored
doing nothing but training!

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.090
Where's Emily?!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:36.030
A strange little girl appears
during my frantic search.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:40.670
On the next Soukou no Strain:
"Gall Space Supply Depot"

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.400
Who are you?
